            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 28,
            "text": "財團法人職業災害預防及重建中心  本法職業災害預防及職業災害勞工重建業務",
            "score": 0.8041715621948242,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 70,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 29,
            "text": "職業災害勞工 得終止勞動契約 之一",
            "score": 0.8029351234436035,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 85,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 30,
            "text": "本法施行前，仍參加勞工保險職業災害保險或就業保險之被保險人 其保險效力之開始 自本法施行之日起算",
            "score": 0.8028416633605957,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 13,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 31,
            "text": "雇主 未依第一項規定期間預告而終止契約 勞動契約",
            "score": 0.8024215698242188,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 19,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 32,
            "text": "雇主 依本法第六十七條提供 職業災害勞工從事工作必要之輔助設施",
            "score": 0.8020849227905273,
            "source_doc_id": "de1995ed-8bbd-551b-b91a-39bf12eeb05e",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 3,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 33,
            "text": "依第十二條或第十五條規定終止勞動契約者 不得向雇主請求加發 預告期間工資及資遣費",
            "score": 0.8015460968017578,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 22,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 34,
            "text": "所屬勞工 請領之保險給付得抵充其依勞動基准法第五十九條規定應負擔的職業災害補償",
            "score": 0.8007779121398926,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 36,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 35,
            "text": "雇主 依第八十四條第一項第二款，或勞工依前條第一項第一款規定終止勞動契約 發給勞工退休金及適用勞動基準法規定發給勞工資遣費",
            "score": 0.8002662658691406,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 86,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 36,
            "text": "勞工 因職業災害所致之損害 雇主應負賠償責任",
            "score": 0.7998676300048828,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 7,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 37,
            "text": "事業單位改組或轉讓後所留用之勞工 因職業災害致身心障礙、喪失部分或全部工作能力者 新雇主",
            "score": 0.7997822761535645,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 87,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 38,
            "text": "事業單位或承攬人 就其所補償之部分，對於職業災害勞工之雇主，有求償權 職業災害勞工",
            "score": 0.7991843223571777,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 31,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "fact",
            "rank": 39,
            "text": "雇主應提繳保險費之收繳情形 於 繳納期限之次月七日前通知勞保局",
            "score": 0.7989850044250488,
            "source_doc_id": "08b337cc-04b8-56a1-a91e-ff5f0e666a4e",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": 40,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 0,
            "text": "勞工職業災害保險由勞動部勞工保險局辦理保險業務。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 1,
            "text": "職業災害勞工 對雇主依第六十七條第一項規定安置之工作未能達成協議",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 2,
            "text": "職業災害勞工依第二十四條第一款規定勞動契約終止。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 3,
            "text": "職業災害勞工屬於書件。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "de1995ed-8bbd-551b-b91a-39bf12eeb05e",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 4,
            "text": "職業災害勞工得以勞工團體或保險人委託之有關團體為投保單位，未參加勞工保險者亦可受惠。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 5,
            "text": "職業災害勞工進行功能性能力評估。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 6,
            "text": "職業災害勞工從事工作必要之輔助設施由事業單位提供。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 7,
            "text": "職業災害勞工經醫療終止後，疑似有身心障礙。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 8,
            "text": "職業災害勞工得以終止勞動契約之一。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 9,
            "text": "職業災害勞工需適當之工作機會。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 10,
            "text": "職業災害勞工在聲請保全或假執行時，法院得減免其應供擔保之金額。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 11,
            "text": "職業災害勞工得向中央主管機關認可之職能復健專業機構提出申請，協助其擬訂復工計畫。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 12,
            "text": "職業災害勞工進行職業災害勞工工作分析。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 13,
            "text": "職業災害勞工接受生理心理功能之強化訓練。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 14,
            "text": "職業災害勞工 經醫療終止後，雇主應依前條第一項所定復工計畫，並協助其恢復原工作 原工作",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 15,
            "text": "職業災害勞工終止勞動契約時，準用勞動基準法規定預告僱主。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 16,
            "text": "僱主違反第六十七條第一項規定，未協助職業災害勞工恢復原工作或安置適當之工作。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 17,
            "text": "事業單位僱用了職業災害勞工。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 18,
            "text": "當地社會行政主管機關協助職業災害勞工。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 19,
            "text": "事業單位或承攬人就其所補償之部分，對於職業災害勞工的僱主有求償權。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 20,
            "text": "職業災害勞工 事業單位改組或轉讓，致事業單位消滅",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 21,
            "text": "主管機關得依其意願及工作能力協助職業災害勞工。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 22,
            "text": "終止勞動契約時得準用勞動基準法規定預告勞工。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 23,
            "text": "僱主依前項規定預告終止勞動契約。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "a4c0d396-d8e9-5a83-8655-e5b7c673100d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 24,
            "text": "勞動基準法未規定之事項適用該法未明確處理的情況。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "fe73f47a-4191-544b-b1d1-b4c6d934c22c",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 25,
            "text": "本規則依勞動基準法辦理。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "961e2185-b4f1-5043-b3fc-ba919d6cef05",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 26,
            "text": "職業災害補償依勞動基準法規定辦理。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 27,
            "text": "受僱者於育嬰留職停薪期間不得與他人另訂勞動契約。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "e3690812-61f7-546f-b2d1-316528b1b415",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 28,
            "text": "勞動契約為他人利益著想。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 29,
            "text": "勞動契約可以分為定期契約及不定期契約。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 30,
            "text": "勞動契約的預告期間依照左列各款之規定。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 31,
            "text": "勞動契約準用勞動基準法規定預告僱主。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 32,
            "text": "僱主未依第一項規定期間預告而終止勞動契約。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 33,
            "text": "本條例所稱勞動契約是指概念。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "08b337cc-04b8-56a1-a91e-ff5f0e666a4e",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": true
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 34,
            "text": "任何人不得干涉勞動契約。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 35,
            "text": "中央主管機關辦理職業災害研究。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "fe73f47a-4191-544b-b1d1-b4c6d934c22c",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 36,
            "text": "未加入勞工保險而遭遇職業災害之勞工於本法施行後發生職業災害。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "b90844e9-08c1-5886-8d35-a1fecaff511a",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          },
          {
            "kind": "triple",
            "rank": 37,
            "text": "承攬人或再承攬人所僱用勞工發生職業災害。",
            "score": null,
            "source_doc_id": "14227a65-e016-52cd-affa-507925253d7d",
            "source_svo_chunk_index": null,
            "article_no": null,
            "in_prompt": false
          }
        ],
        "hit_exact_spans": [
